nting looks like a great outlet for expressing yourself.", "[Caroline, Session 14, 1:33 pm on 25 August, 2023] Thanks, Melanie! I painted it after I visited the beach last week. Just seeing the sun dip below the horizon, all the amazing colors - it was amazing and calming. So I just had to try to capture that feeling in my painting.", "[Melanie, Session 14, 1:33 pm on 25 August, 2023] Wow, the beach really inspired you. The art really took me to that moment and I can feel the serenity. You captured the sunset perfectly, so peaceful!", "[Melanie, Session 17, 10:31 am on 13 October, 2023] Yeah, Here's one I did last week. It's inspired by the sunsets. The colors make me feel calm. What have you been up to lately, artistically?", "[Caroline, Session 9, 2:31 pm on 17 July, 2023] Thanks, Melanie! I painted this after I visited a LGBTQ center. I wanted to capture everyone's unity and strength.", "[Melanie, Session 14, 1:33 pm on 25 August, 2023] Wow Caroline, that looks amazing! Those colors are so vivid, it really looks like a real sunset. What gave you the idea to paint it?"], "build_stats": {"n_nodes": 419, "n_edges_total": 4125, "n_entity_edges": 966}, "pred_full_ctx": "Melanie painted a lake sunrise last year, but the specific date is not mentioned.", "ok_full_ctx": 0, "retrieval_diagnostics": {"gold_evidence_node_ids": ["n_12"], "gold_node_found": true, "best_semantic_rank_global": 299, "best_semantic_sim": 0.331539, "gold_in_seed_list": false, "gold_in_expanded_set": false, "gold_in_final_topk": false, "gold_rerank_position_among_expanded": null, "gold_turn_raw_text_in_graph_evidence": false, "per_reference": [{"dia_id": "D1:12", "resolved": true, "matched_node_ids": ["n_12"], "best_semantic_rank": 299, "best_semantic_sim": 0.331539}]}}
